          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shows each item as it looks in the menu bar. Without Screen & System Audio Recording, app icons are shown." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按每一项在菜单栏中的样子显示。未允许“录屏与系统录音”时，显示 App 图标。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Used only to capture the menu bar and to match the Rolltop Bar to what is behind it. Nothing leaves this Mac. macOS may ask you to reopen Rolltop after allowing it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "仅用于截取菜单栏，以及让 Rolltop 栏与背后的内容相协调。任何内容都不会离开这台 Mac。允许后，macOS 可能会要求你重新打开 Rolltop。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "item images, real icons, screenshots, screen recording, cache" : {
